          "q": "What is the standard architectural approach?",
          "options": [
            "Use test.describe('checkout') and run `npx playwright test -g \"checkout\"`.",
            "Put all checkout tests in a single checkout.spec.ts file and hardcode the path.",
            "Use the --only CLI flag.",
            "Comment out the other 450 tests before running."
          ],
          "a": "Use test.describe('checkout') and run `npx playwright test -g \"checkout\"`.",
          "explanation": "The -g (grep) flag allows you to run tests matching a specific title or tag across your entire codebase, making it the standard way to run logical suites."
        }
      ],
