          "a": "Change `npm install` to `npm ci` in the CI pipeline.",
          "explanation": "`npm ci` (clean install) ignores the `package.json` loose versioning and strictly installs the exact versions locked in `package-lock.json`. It also deletes the `node_modules` folder beforehand, ensuring a pristine, repeatable environment."
