            "await page.goto('https://example.com');",
            "await browser.get('https://example.com');",
            "await window.location('https://example.com');"
          ],
          "a": "await page.goto('https://example.com');",
          "explanation": "In Playwright, the `page` object represents a single tab/context, and `goto()` is the standard method used to navigate to a specific URL."
        }
