          "a": "Extracting multiple UI elements into an object is not a native Web-First Assertion; it evaluates instantly. If the UI is still fetching data, it extracts empty strings and fails. `expect.poll()` mathematically forces Playwright to continuously re-extract and re-compare the generated Entity until it matches the expected Entity or times out.",
