          "a": "test.fixme()",
          "explanation": "`test.fixme()` tells the Playwright engine: 'Do not execute this test, and explicitly mark it in the report as needing attention.' It is superior to commenting out the test because it remains visible in the telemetry dashboard as technical debt."
