          "explanation": "This is Enterprise CI orchestration. You might have 50 `@smoke` tests, but 3 of them take 2 minutes each (`@slow`). In a PR pipeline where you need instant feedback, you use `--grep-invert` to surgically amputate the slow tests from the execution graph."
