          "a": [
            "Use `test.info().annotations.push({ type: 'issue', description: 'Jira-1234' });` inside the test execution.",
            "In modern Playwright, pass a metadata object to the `test` declaration: `test('Verify login', { tag: '@smoke', annotation: { type: 'issue', description: 'Jira-1234' } }, async () => { ... })`."
          ],
          "explanation": "Annotations elevate a testing framework into a Management Information System. By explicitly injecting Jira ticket IDs or Author names into the metadata, the HTML report becomes a heavily searchable database mapping code directly to Agile business tracking."
