          "scenario": "Your framework has an advanced Custom Fixture that analyzes tags. If it sees `@admin`, it automatically provisions an Admin user.",
          "q": "How does a Fixture programmatically read the tags assigned to the currently executing test? (Select all that apply)",
          "options": [
            "It reads the file system.",
            "It accesses the `testInfo` object injected into the fixture: `testInfo.title` or `testInfo.tags`. The fixture performs a string analysis on the title (or checks the tags array) to dynamically adjust its setup routing.",
