          "explanation": "This represents the zenith of dynamic execution. Tags are not just for the CLI. Fixtures can dynamically read the `testInfo` object at runtime. If a test is tagged `@mobile`, the Fixture can read that tag and automatically resize the viewport, creating self-configuring tests."
