          "scenario": "You are testing a massive financial table with 1,000 cells. You want to extract all 1,000 values, compare them to a local JSON baseline, and report *every single cell* that doesn't match.",
          "q": "Why will looping 1,000 `expect.soft()` assertions completely destroy the performance of the CI pipeline?",
