          "a": "To provide an automated, cloud-based Linux environment that mathematically intercepts every Pull Request, runs the entire E2E test suite, and forcefully blocks the PR from merging if any tests fail.",
          "explanation": "GitHub Actions is the ultimate Quality Gate. It removes human emotion from the equation. If the YAML script says 'test failed', the code does not deploy. It is absolute governance.",
