          "a": "An `actions/upload-artifact` step. The CI container is ephemeral and instantly deleted when the job ends. You must explicitly instruct GitHub to ZIP the `playwright-report/` directory and upload it to the GitHub servers for later human download.",
          "explanation": "Ephemeral environments exist only for seconds. If you want proof of what happened (logs, traces, videos), you must explicitly 'upload' the artifacts out of the container before it implodes."
