            "It makes the test code shorter."
          ],
          "a": [
            "In CI (`process.env.CI`), you must use the `workerIndex` to mathematically guarantee that 10 parallel CI workers don't try to migrate the exact same DB schema simultaneously, causing deadlocks.",
            "Locally (`!process.env.CI`), you might want to skip the dynamic generation and just use a static local database (`test_db_local`) to save time during rapid debugging."
          ],
          "explanation": "This is 'Polymorphic Fixture Design'. The Fixture alters its behavior based on the environment context, aggressively isolating state in the cloud while optimizing for speed on the developer's laptop."
