            "The `PWDEBUG=1` environment variable is a native Playwright mechanism. When it is present, Playwright's C++ orchestrator automatically launches the Inspector and forces execution into a stepped, debug mode, overriding timeouts globally. You never need to write manual `if` statements to handle it.",
            "It crashes the linter.",
            "It bypasses the API."
